@baseUrl = http://localhost:4001/api
@token = INSIRA_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Listar Orçamentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar Orçamento (agrupando ordens)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "orderIds": ["ID_ORDEM_1", "ID_ORDEM_2"]
}

### Obter Orçamento Específico
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets/ID_DO_ORCAMENTO
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar Orçamento
PUT {{baseUrl}}/budgets/ID_DO_ORCAMENTO
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "totalBudget": 500.00
}

### Deletar Orçamento
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/budgets/ID_DO_ORCAMENTO
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
